cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Unreasonable Confidence from Simulator Misspecification: Directional
  Robustness on the SPEED+ Sim-to-Real Benchmark
message: >-
  If you use this code, please cite the paper. If you use the SPEED+
  dataset, cite Park et al. as well (see references below) - this
  repository redistributes none of it.
