identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.24011140
    description: The code, all archived releases (concept DOI).
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.24011141
    description: >-
      The code at tag sim2science-2026-camera-ready, behind the workshop
      version.
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.24140385
    description: >-
      The 17 trained checkpoints, with their model card. Licensed CC BY 4.0,
      separately from the code.
keywords:
  - spacecraft pose estimation
  - 6D pose estimation
  - sim-to-real
  - domain gap
  - conformal prediction
  - SPEED+

